HYP-3431 CANONICAL CORRIDOR-FENCE CERTIFICATE
==============================================================================
Assumption challenge:
  alternate vertices considered: runners, fixed corridors, corridor walls,
  high-grid wall events, odd branch walls, even half-speeds, owner labels,
  Fourier modes, and proof obligations.
  chosen tournament vertices: proof carriers / wall certificates.
  preserved predicate: two-branch relocation for S_m={1..11,13,84m}.
  destroyed if scalarized: endpoint ownership, branch choice, and the
  distinction between fixed low corridors and moving high-grid holes.

